        ],
        "text": "The parties appearing before the Court were: Petitioner Jeffrey L. Fisher, Esq. (Stanford, CA); Respondent William B. Collins, Esq., Deputy Solicitor General (Olympia, WA); and United States amicus curiae Matthew D. Roberts, Esq., Assistant to the Solicitor General (Washington, D.C.)."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Souter",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f2841bde5fe76e139787612a7269a63e05369e469d92506564643bb02e617743",
