            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Souter, the central issue is whether a judge\u2019s decision to impose consecutive sentences requires a factual finding beyond the jury\u2019s verdict, as required by the Apprendi\u2011Blakely rule."
      }
