          "text": "According to Petitioner, petitioner asserts that the Ninth Circuit\u2019s statement that the Blakely rule was unclear is wrong; the Supreme Court\u2019s Apprendi decision already defined the statutory maximum as the maximum based solely on the jury verdict."
