              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to United States (amicus curiae), according to United States (amicus curiae), the amicus notes that Washington\u2019s sentencing guidelines channel but do not eliminate judicial discretion, which could be analogized to traditional sentencing systems not constrained by Apprendi."
        },
        {
